# Cells for runs/2026-10-16-strata.md, stage 8: the deployed llama.cpp configuration
# (qwen38fn-gpu2.env on main, b11505) on CT 123 through ./placement-sweep.sh with PROBE_CHAT=true,
# REPS=1 per round. The cell is the prefill-slowdown record's h37, which reproduces that env:
